          <mxGeometry height="24" width="80" x="120" y="1128" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c51" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=12;" value="Cardinality ratio (1 = one, N = many) written beside the entity it counts" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="720" x="240" y="1128" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c52" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;b&gt;Constraints and assumptions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Chapter (UC-01): chapter_id is system generated and unique; title is NOT NULL and not blank (BR-01).&lt;br&gt;2. ChapterComponent (UC-02, UC-03) is a weak entity: it exists only for one Chapter and is identified by chapter_id + component_type. A chapter has at most one component of each type.&lt;br&gt;3. component_type is one of: LEARNING_OBJECTIVES, PERSIAN_DIALOGUE, PERSIAN_READING, URDU_EXPLANATION, GRAMMAR_NOTE, EXAMPLES, GLOSSARY. order_index is unique within a chapter.&lt;br&gt;4. GlossaryEntry (UC-04) belongs to exactly one Chapter (total participation); persian_word and urdu_meaning are NOT NULL (BR-03). The GLOSSARY component shows these entries.&lt;br&gt;5. is_complete is derived: true when every selected component has content (BR-02).&lt;br&gt;6. Deleting a Chapter deletes its components and glossary entries (FR-CH-07, NFR-RL-03): ON DELETE CASCADE.&lt;br&gt;7. All text is stored as UTF-8 (utf8mb4 in MySQL) for Persian and Urdu." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250" width="520" x="1060" y="720" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c53" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;b&gt;Persian Learning App: EER diagram (Chen notation), Iteration 1&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="34" width="900" x="50" y="23" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
